  "pr": {
    "description": "### Overview\\nThird in the layout stack (#94 → #95 → this): \`packages/persistence\`'s 16 flat \`src/\` files folded into role folders. Stacked on #95; merge in order, rebases are clean (disjoint packages).\\n\\n**Pure restructure — zero behavior change.** Every moved file is byte-identical except relative-import paths (verified per-file against the base branch). \`lib.ts\` re-exports the exact same symbol set; the D2b containment is untouched (\`AppDrizzle\` + \`internal()\` stay module-private, now in \`db/handle.ts\`).\\n\\n### Layout\\n\`\`\`\\nsrc/\\n  lib.ts              ENTRY — sectioned re-exports = the public surface\\n  testing.ts          ENTRY (persistence/testing) — PGlite harness + graphile stub\\n  types.ts            branded ids + Result/ValueOf re-export\\n  db/                 the opaque handle + its lifecycle\\n    handle.ts  config.ts  migrate.ts\\n  schema/             drizzle table definitions (unchanged)\\n  stores/             ctx-bound + projection data access\\n    tenant.ts  artifact-store.ts  generation.ts  ingest.ts  purge.ts  audit.ts  user-settings.ts\\n  auth/               PRE-tenant resolvers (they PRODUCE the tenant) + crypto\\n    session.ts  token.ts  crypto.ts\\n\`\`\`\\n\`testing.ts\` stays at root — it is the \`exports[\\"./testing\\"]\` subpath target (path unchanged for the api/cli test consumers). Rename along the move: \`db.ts\` → \`db/handle.ts\` (kills the \`db/db.ts\` stutter; matches the \\"opaque handle\\" vocabulary).\\n\\n### Changelog\\n- Moved 13 files into \`db/\` / \`stores/\` / \`auth/\`; root keeps \`lib.ts\`, \`testing.ts\`, \`types.ts\`\\n- \`lib.ts\` rewritten as sectioned re-exports grouped by folder (same symbols, per-export docs + D2b containment note kept)\\n- \`AGENTS.md\`: package map + entry-points callout; \`src/db.ts\` / \`src/audit.ts\` references updated\\n- Test imports updated; two stale comment paths fixed (\`packages/types/src/lib.ts\`, \`packages/worker/src/payload.ts\` pointed at \`persistence/src/ingest.ts\`)\\n\\n### Verification\\n- persistence: 149 tests pass, \`tsc --noEmit\` clean\\n- Dependents: api (141) + worker (34) + cli (69) + apps/web (532) all pass, all typecheck\\n- Repo-root \`pnpm lint\` exit 0\\n- Per-file old-path→new-path diffs: import lines only; import graph verified cycle-free (schema → db → stores → auth)\\n- CI checks will show the known billing failures — local runs above are the substitute, same as #94/#95.",
